<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Petsmart Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Petsmart Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst Bo Cheadle said he raised his rating on Petsmart Inc to a buy from a hold.  No further details were given.</p>
</text>
